e Macallan Sherry Oak Cask 30 year</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥58800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">麦卡伦耀钻 <span class=\"en-name\">The Macallan No.6</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥58800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">麦卡伦璀璨 <span class=\"en-name\">The Macallan M</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥78800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">麦卡伦璀璨·黑 <span class=\"en-name\">The Macallan M Black</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥88800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"name\">麦卡伦璀璨·金 <span class=\"en-name\">The Macallan M Copper</span></div><div class=\"price\">¥98800 /瓶</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"card-tip\">以上套餐包含软饮2 · 禁止向未成年人出售酒水</div>\n                </div>\n            ",
